        <mxCell id="panel-t1" value="The existing &lt;b&gt;AWS Visual Asset Management System (VAMS)&lt;/b&gt; solution provides the API (&lt;b&gt;Amazon API Gateway&lt;/b&gt; with its custom &lt;b&gt;AWS Lambda&lt;/b&gt; authorizer), the authorization, database and asset tables in &lt;b&gt;Amazon DynamoDB&lt;/b&gt;, the vector embeddings table, which every deployment has, and, when enabled, &lt;b&gt;Amazon OpenSearch Service&lt;/b&gt;. Vector search adds the &lt;code&gt;POST /search/nlp&lt;/code&gt; route, the search function and the table's vector index." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="layer-workflow">
