          <mxGeometry x="1038" y="292.5" width="25" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="panel-t2" value="A user describes what they are looking for in the web interface's natural-language search, with &lt;code&gt;vamscli search nlp&lt;/code&gt;, or with the MCP &lt;code&gt;search_nlp&lt;/code&gt; tool. The request reaches &lt;code&gt;POST /search/nlp&lt;/code&gt;, which exists only when vector search is enabled, and the authorizer validates the caller's token." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="layer-workflow">
          <mxGeometry x="1074" y="271" width="524" height="68" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="panel-b3" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#fcfcfc&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#66B2FF;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="layer-workflow">
          <mxGeometry x="1038" y="390" width="25" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="panel-t3" value="The natural-language search function (&lt;b&gt;AWS Lambda&lt;/b&gt;) checks that the caller's roles may call the route, then scans the database table for the databases the caller may read. A caller who reads every database and names none gets one search over the whole index; otherwise the search runs once per readable database (the named ones when the request names databases), at most 200." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="layer-workflow">
          <mxGeometry x="1074" y="361" width="524" height="83" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="panel-b4" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#fcfcfc&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#66B2FF;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="layer-workflow">
          <mxGeometry x="1038" y="472.5" width="25" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="panel-t4" value="The query is embedded with the same &lt;b&gt;Amazon Bedrock&lt;/b&gt; embeddings model the vector index was built with." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="layer-workflow">
          <mxGeometry x="1074" y="466" width="524" height="38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="panel-b5" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#fcfcfc&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#66B2FF;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="layer-workflow">
          <mxGeometry x="1038" y="555" width="25" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="panel-t5" value="&lt;b&gt;Amazon DynamoDB&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;SearchVectors&lt;/code&gt; runs on the vector index for each target: a breadth call over whole-file vectors and, unless the request sets &lt;code&gt;includeSegments&lt;/code&gt; to false, a depth call over every item. Each call returns up to 100 candidates, filtered to the latest version of each file, to live items unless archived ones are requested, and to the index's model." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="layer-workflow">
          <mxGeometry x="1074" y="526" width="524" height="83" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="panel-b6" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#fcfcfc&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#66B2FF;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="layer-workflow">
          <mxGeometry x="1038" y="652.5" width="25" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="panel-t6" value="The function merges the candidates by distance, collapses them to one hit per file version, ranks them with the file-type bonus, reads the matching asset rows and keeps only the hits whose asset the caller may read, with the same Casbin check as every other asset read." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="layer-workflow">
          <mxGeometry x="1074" y="631" width="524" height="68" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="panel-b7" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#fcfcfc&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#66B2FF;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="layer-workflow">
          <mxGeometry x="1038" y="735" width="25" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="panel-t7" value="When an OpenSearch mode is enabled, &lt;b&gt;Amazon OpenSearch Service&lt;/b&gt; is queried over the hits' document ids, 100 per query: the keyword search's filters, metadata and geo constraints and tags are applied, and the indexed fields are added to each hit." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="layer-workflow">
          <mxGeometry x="1074" y="721" width="524" height="53" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="panel-b8" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#fcfcfc&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#66B2FF;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="layer-workflow">
          <mxGeometry x="1038" y="810" width="25" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="panel-t8" value="The answer uses the keyword search's response envelope, with &lt;code&gt;_score&lt;/code&gt;, the &lt;code&gt;_vector&lt;/code&gt; block, the &lt;code&gt;nlp&lt;/code&gt; block, warnings and aggregations; asset mode groups the hits by asset. While the vector index is being built, the route answers &lt;code&gt;503&lt;/code&gt;." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="layer-workflow">
          <mxGeometry x="1074" y="796" width="524" height="53" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>